OL,3,AMel Stride replaced as shadow
OL,4,Achancellor as Conservatives reshuffle
OL,5,Acabinet
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Mel Stride has been replaced as
OL,8,Fshadow chancellor as part of
OL,9,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch's
OL,10,Freshuffle.
OL,12,FHe is being replaced by Andrew
OL,13,FGriffith, the party announced. Claire
OL,14,FCoutinho, previously the shadow energy
OL,15,Fsecretary, will replace Griffith as
OL,16,Fshadow business secretary amid the
OL,17,Fongoing shake-up.
OL,19,FBadenoch is carrying out a reshuffle of
OL,20,Fher shadow cabinet before the party's
OL,21,Fconference in October.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
